  "details": "# Issue: \n\nWhen looking at a Group Queue in the Main Menu before Joining you will see how many people are already in a Queue. When having join said Queue you will see your place in the queue / how many people are in the queue.\n\nThe problem however is that both of these have no tool tips in the Main Menu, which makes it really hard understand what each number means without someone telling you.\n\n# Expected Behavior:\n\nBoth of these should have tooltips.  \n\n1. Current amount Users in Queue.  \n\n2. Your place in Queue / Users in Queue.",
